From 61b86bf286d3bc5293a34a44d2d4a0d50c4beb5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:08:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf(network): send chunk-sent chiseled block sync only
 to receiving player

The chunk sent event fires per player from PlayerChunkSender.sendChunk after the
chunk left that player's pending set, so the receiving player was already one of the
tracking players. Other tracking players received the same full state on their own
chunk sent event and every later change through the block entity sync packets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
---
 .../mod/chiselsandbits/registrars/ModEventHandler.java     | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/src/main/java/mod/chiselsandbits/registrars/ModEventHandler.java b/core/src/main/java/mod/chiselsandbits/registrars/ModEventHandler.java
index 0e48a3a..ed88d65 100755
--- a/core/src/main/java/mod/chiselsandbits/registrars/ModEventHandler.java
+++ b/core/src/main/java/mod/chiselsandbits/registrars/ModEventHandler.java
@@ -121,9 +121,12 @@ public final class ModEventHandler {
                     .filter(ChiseledBlockEntity.class::isInstance)
                     .map(ChiseledBlockEntity.class::cast)
                     .forEach(chiseledBlockEntity -> {
-                        ChiselsAndBits.getInstance().getNetworkChannel().sendToTrackingChunk(
+                        // Only the player that just received the chunk needs the full state; every other
+                        // tracking player already got it through its own chunk sent event and the incremental
+                        // block entity syncs since then.
+                        ChiselsAndBits.getInstance().getNetworkChannel().sendToPlayer(
                                 new UpdateChiseledBlockPacket(chiseledBlockEntity),
-                                serverLevel.getChunkAt(chiseledBlockEntity.getBlockPos())
+                                serverPlayer
                         );
                     });
         });
